==Macedonian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/pɔ/|lang=mk}}

===Prefix===
{{head|mk|prefix|tr=po|sc=Cyrl}}

# for a [[while]], [[a little]]
#: {{lang|mk|[[спие]]}} — ''to sleep''
#: {{lang|mk|[[поспие]]}} — ''to have some sleep, to sleep a little''
# [[perfective aspect]]
#: {{lang|mk|[[иде]]}} — ''to go'' ([[impf.]])
#: {{lang|mk|[[појде]]}} — ''to go'' ([[pf.]])
# [[-er]], [[more]]... (a comparative in adjectives and adverbs)
#: {{lang|mk|[[евтин]]}} — ''cheap''
#: {{lang|mk|[[поевтин]]}} — ''cheaper''
#: {{lang|mk|[[често]]}} — ''often''
#: {{lang|mk|[[почесто]]}} — ''more often'', ''oftener''

